      "notes": [
        "Students' names stay in your sheets: students sign in by typing their own name and PIN (no class list is sent to iPads, and the slides keep none)",
        "Hand-ins are named by class and a student code (S001, S002…) instead of a name, and Claude marking sees only codes",
        "Worksheets are checked for a Name line: students are told not to write there, and anything written on it is left out of the PDF they hand in; the Hub flags Name lines when you upload, with Cover it for me",
        "The Rewards leaderboard shows initials; and Setup check has a switch so the Teacher Hub needs your Google account, not only the PIN"
      ]
    }
  ],
